  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<pre class=\"syntax\">enum class SMState :         <a class=\"cppref\" href=\"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/types/integer\" title=\"cppreference.com (C++17)\">std::uint8_t</a> {...};</pre>",
   "tail": "\n"
  },
  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<div class=\"desc\"><p>The state of the E2E supervision after the most recent check of a received sample of the event. If <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"ns_com_ara_com_e2e_f19464.html#SWS_CM_90422\">ara::com::e2e::SMState</a> == kValid, and the <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"../classes/cl_ara_com_SamplePtr_f95130.html\">ara::com::SamplePtr</a>:: GetProfileCheckStatus did not result in an Error then, the last checked sample can be used.</p></div>",
   "tail": "\n\n"
